"DATA","BHM4CAN002","1.20","4.80","Stiff fissured reddish brown gravelly CLAY. Gravel is angular fine to medium lithorelicts of very stiff clay to extremely weak mudstone. Relict fissures are randomly orientated and extremely closely spaced. (weathering grade III)","204","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
"DATA","BHM4CAN002","4.80","6.70","Very stiff indistinctly fissured reddish brown very gravelly CLAY. Gravel is angular fine to coarse lithorelicts of extremely weak mudstone. Relict fissures are randomly orientated, extremely closely to very closely spaced, locally stained black, and with clay infill. (weathering grade III)","204","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
"DATA","BHM4CAN002","6.70","7.70","Extremely weak reddish brown mottled greenish grey MUDSTONE. Non intact drilling disturbed recovered as slightly sandy clayey subangular and subrounded fine to coarse mudstone gravel, with a low subangular mudstone cobble content. (weathering grade II)","801","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
"DATA","BHM4CAN002","7.70","8.20","Limited Recovery. Soft reddish brown mottled grey sandy gravelly CLAY. Gravel is subrounded medium to coarse mudstone and fine to medium mudstone lithorelicts. Sand is fine to coarse. (weathering grade IVb)","220","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
"DATA","BHM4CAN002","8.20","9.50","Limited Recovery. Soft brown slightly sandy slightly gravelly CLAY with a low subangular mudstone cobble content. Gravel is subangular and subrounded fine to coarse mudstone. Sand is fine to coarse. (weathering grade IVb)","220","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
"DATA","BHM4CAN002","9.50","9.60","Limited Recovery. Very stiff indistinctly structured reddish brown very gravelly CLAY, with frequent greenish grey reduction spots. Gravel is angular and subangular fine to coarse weak mudstone lithorelicts. (weathering grade III)","204","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
