"DATA","BHM4CAN007A","19.50","20.15","Stiff to very stiff dark reddish brown gravelly silty CLAY with rare greenish grey reduction spots (up to 20mm). Gravel is angular to subangular fine to coarse mudstone lithorelicts. One 10º fissure, undulating smooth. (weathering grade III)","208","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
