"DATA","BHM4CAN007A","20.90","21.50","Extremely weak to very weak dark reddish brown MUDSTONE with rare light bluish grey reduction spots (up to 5mm). Fractures are 10° to 70°, extremely closely to medium spaced, undulating and smooth. (weathering grade II)","801","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
