"DATA","BHM4CAN008","19.29","23.56","Extremely weak to very weak reddish brown calcareous MUDSTONE with occasional greenish grey reduction spots and bands (up to 45mm) and rare gypsum crystals (up to 4mm). Fractures are 10°, medium to widely spaced, planar, rough rarely smooth with rare gypsum infill. (weathering grade II)","801","MERCIA MUDSTONE GROUP","MMG","","","","",""
