"DATA","BHM4CANA067","CP+RC","DRAFT","327323.45","184136.31","","11.61","Inspection pit hand excavated from 0.00 mbgl to 1.20 mbgl. Cable percussive drilling from 1.20 mbgl to 5.20 mbgl. Rotary coring from 5.20 mbgl to 11.00 mbgl. Borehole installed upon completion. Shallow installation between 0.00 mbgl and 3.50 mbgl with a response zone between 1.00 mbgl and 3.50 mbgl. Deep installation between 0.00 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl with a response zone between 4.50 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl.","11.00","2018-10-02","","Target depth reached.","2018-10-09","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","GR",""
"DATA","BHM4CANA068","CP+RC","DRAFT","327137.56","184295.17","","15.70","Inspection pit hand excavated from 0.00 mbgl to 1.20 mbgl. Cable percussive drilling from 1.20 mbgl to 4.60 mbgl. Rotary drilling from 4.60 mbgl to 10.00 mbgl. Borehole installed upon completion. Installation between 0.00 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl with a response zone between 2.00 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl.","10.00","2018-10-01","","Target depth reached.","2018-10-05","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","GR",""
"DATA","BHM4CANA069","CP+RC","DRAFT","327281.49","184315.94","","14.54","Inspection pit hand excavated from 0.00 mbgl to 1.20 mbgl. Cable percussive drilling from 1.20 mbgl to 7.90 mbgl. Rotary coring from 7.90 mbgl to 10.00 mbgl. Borehole installed upon completion. Shallow installation between 0.00 mbgl and 6.50 mbgl with a response zone between 1.00 mbgl and 6.50 mbgl. Deep installation between 0.00 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl with a response zone between 7.50 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl.","10.00","2018-10-04","","Target depth reached.","2018-10-11","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","GR",""
"DATA","BHM4CANA070","CP+RC","FINAL","344639.86","187841.32","","18.42","Inspection pit hand excavated from ground level to 1.20 mbgl. Rotary coring from 1.20 mbgl to 10.00 mbgl. No groundwater encountered. There was consideration made as to whether Made Ground terminated at 6.00 mbgl and the grey siltstone represents natural bedrock. Whilst the borehole was cased, it is accepted that the water flush may be insufficiently strong to remove coarse material and therefore material from the Made Ground may be dragged down and be recovered at the top of lower runs. Mixed lithology characteristic of the Made Ground was found at the top of each run between and inclusive of 6.00 m and 9.00m. However, mixed lithology was found at 6.30 - 6.40m between two solid core of strong siltstone (assumed to be representative of cobble/boulder fraction of the Made Ground in the log). This together with the absence of recovery between 8.00 and 9.00m suggests the case of bringing the Made Ground/Mercia Mudstone at 9.00m. Borehole installed upon completion. Installation between 0.00 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl with response zone between 2.00 mbgl and 10.00 mbgl.","10.00","2018-11-26","","Target depth reached.","2018-12-04","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","GR",""

